{"repositoryId":1053239016,"availability":"available","full":"ivucicev/toodoom","name":"toodoom","description":"Boring Todo","category":"Productivity","language":"JavaScript","stars":45,"forks":2,"created":"2025-09-09T07:13:27Z","updated":"2026-10-01T05:30:53Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://toodoom.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://toodoom.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:22.836Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:22.836Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:22.836Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T02:48:22.836Z","stars":45,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Toodoom began as a weekend idea after noticing that every simple tasks app had turned into a dashboard for teams. We just wanted a gentle place where my wife and I could share an @shopping list, keep track of @household fixes, and scribble personal notes. The result is a shareable, offline-first desk that feels like a calm gradient garden. My wife and I use it every day now. Switch between notes and tasks, drop in #tags, assign @categories, and keep life admin tidy without corporate bloat. Try the hosted demos at toodoom.vercel.app or toodoom.ibreakthings.xyz."],"features":["✨ Dual brain – maintain boards of tasks and sticky notes in the same app.","🏷️ Smart metadata – apply #tags for instant filtering and @categories for lightweight project buckets.","🤝 Shareable lists – invite a partner, housemate, or family member to any @category and stay in sync together (PocketBase-backed).","🌙 Light & dark – polished themes that automatically remember your preference.","📱 PWA-ready – install Toodoom on desktop or mobile and run it like a native app."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ivucicev/toodoom/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fe0ab27764cfa3b2f1f1ed0fea53f6812e99b201099b5412a4d5f0e27dad4feb","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:22.949Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:22.949Z","projectInsights":{"version":1